  "body_html": "<p>Elevate any bedroom with this personalized Baseball Comforter Set, thoughtfully designed for sports enthusiasts. Showcasing your love for the game, this set from Jeminise offers both comfort and a unique, custom touch, making it an ideal gift for baseball players and fans alike.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> Perfect for baseball players, fans, and lovers, celebrating determination and passion for the sport.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\") to fit various bed sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing Process:</strong> Environmentally friendly finishing ensures dye retention and prevents fading, with smooth, fine, and compact stitching for lasting durability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comfy Material:</strong> Made from 100% Brushed Polyester Fabric, offering a soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Microfiber Filling:</strong> Features whole-piece microfiber filling with tight stitching to prevent clumping or shifting, ensuring consistent comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat for best results, maintaining fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Includes options for personalization with up to two text inputs for a unique touch.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
